<%- include('partials/app-start') %>

  <main id="claude-gateway-page" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-6">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-violet-400">Administração</p>
        <h1 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">Provedores de IA</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400 sm:text-sm">
          Conecte os modelos e escolha qual deles escreverá matérias, títulos e ajustes no Matéria manual.
        </p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" id="claude-refresh"
        class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white">
        Atualizar status
      </button>
    </div>

    <div id="claude-feedback" class="mt-4 hidden rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-xs" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

    <section class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-3 sm:p-4" aria-labelledby="ai-providers-title">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <h2 id="ai-providers-title" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">IA do Matéria manual</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">A escolha vale para a redação, os títulos alternativos e os ajustes feitos em <a href="/materia-manual" class="text-violet-300 hover:text-violet-200">/materia-manual</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <span id="ai-selected-summary" class="rounded-full border border-violet-500/30 bg-violet-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-violet-200">Carregando…</span>
      </div>

      <div id="ai-provider-feedback" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-xs" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <div class="mt-3 grid gap-2 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
        <% (initialProviders.providers || []).forEach(function(provider) { %>
          <article class="ai-provider-card rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/45 p-3 transition" data-provider-card="<%= provider.provider %>">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-white"><%= provider.label %></p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] text-slate-500"><%= provider.provider === 'openai' ? 'API da OpenAI' : provider.provider === 'grok' ? 'API da xAI' : provider.provider === 'deepseek' ? 'API da DeepSeek' : 'Sessão Claude existente' %></p>
              </div>
              <span class="ai-provider-badge rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">—</span>
            </div>

            <label class="mt-3 block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500" for="ai-model-<%= provider.provider %>">Modelo</label>
            <input id="ai-model-<%= provider.provider %>" data-provider-model="<%= provider.provider %>" type="text" value="<%= provider.model %>" autocomplete="off"
              class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-100 outline-none transition focus:border-violet-500">

            <% if (provider.provider !== 'claude') { %>
              <label class="mt-2 block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500" for="ai-key-<%= provider.provider %>">Chave da API</label>
              <input id="ai-key-<%= provider.provider %>" data-provider-key="<%= provider.provider %>" type="password" value="" autocomplete="new-password"
                placeholder="<%= provider.configured ? 'Salva — deixe vazio para manter' : 'Cole a chave aqui' %>"
                class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-100 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:border-violet-500">
            <% } else { %>
              <p class="mt-2 min-h-[34px] text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-500">A autenticação continua sendo feita pela sessão do Chrome, nos controles abaixo.</p>
            <% } %>

            <p class="ai-provider-test mt-2 min-h-[28px] text-[10px] leading-snug text-slate-500"></p>
            <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
              <button type="button" data-ai-action="save" data-provider="<%= provider.provider %>" class="rounded-md border border-slate-700 px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white">Salvar</button>
              <button type="button" data-ai-action="test" data-provider="<%= provider.provider %>" class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/35 bg-sky-500/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-200 hover:bg-sky-500/20">Testar</button>
              <button type="button" data-ai-action="select" data-provider="<%= provider.provider %>" class="ai-provider-select col-span-2 rounded-md bg-violet-500 px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-violet-400">Usar no Matéria manual</button>
              <% if (provider.provider !== 'claude') { %>
                <button type="button" data-ai-action="remove" data-provider="<%= provider.provider %>" class="ai-provider-remove col-span-2 hidden rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-500/10">Remover chave salva</button>
              <% } %>
            </div>
          </article>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">As chaves salvas pelo painel são cifradas no servidor. Elas nunca são devolvidas ao navegador; um campo vazio preserva a credencial atual.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-5">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Sessão do Claude</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">Controles do Claude Sonnet 5 já usado pelo sistema.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="mt-2 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Estado dos serviços">
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Gateway</p>
          <span id="gateway-badge" class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">Verificando</span>
        </div>
        <p id="gateway-title" class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">—</p>
        <p id="gateway-detail" class="mt-1 break-words text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-500">—</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Chrome isolado</p>
          <span id="chrome-badge" class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">Verificando</span>
        </div>
        <p id="chrome-title" class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">—</p>
        <p id="chrome-detail" class="mt-1 break-words text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-500">—</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Conta Claude</p>
          <span id="claude-badge" class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">Verificando</span>
        </div>
        <p id="claude-title" class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">—</p>
        <p id="claude-detail" class="mt-1 break-words text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-500">—</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Modelo</p>
          <span id="model-badge" class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">Verificando</span>
        </div>
        <p id="model-title" class="mt-3 break-all text-sm font-semibold text-white">—</p>
        <p id="model-detail" class="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-500">—</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="claude-auth-progress" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 p-3" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div>
          <p id="claude-auth-label" class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sky-300">Autorização</p>
          <p id="claude-auth-message" class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-sky-100"></p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="claude-login-done" data-action="continue" class="hidden rounded-lg bg-sky-400 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-sky-300 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
          Já entrei, concluir
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="claude-server-desktop" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-violet-500/5 p-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Login no Chrome do servidor</h2>
          <p id="desktop-detail" class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Verificando o desktop privado…</p>
        </div>
        <span id="desktop-badge" class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">Verificando</span>
      </div>
      <ol class="mt-3 grid gap-1.5 pl-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <li>No PowerShell do seu computador, execute o túnel abaixo e deixe a janela aberta.</li>
        <li>Abra o desktop privado e, nesta página, clique em <strong>Entrar novamente</strong>.</li>
        <li>Faça o login no Claude dentro do Chrome exibido. O sistema detecta a sessão e reinicia o gateway automaticamente.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:items-center">
        <code id="desktop-ssh-command" class="min-w-0 flex-1 select-all overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2 text-[11px] text-slate-300">—</code>
        <button type="button" id="desktop-copy" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white">Copiar comando</button>
        <a id="desktop-open" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded-lg bg-violet-500 px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-violet-400">Abrir desktop privado</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">As portas VNC ficam ligadas somente em 127.0.0.1 no servidor. Não publique 5900 ou 6080 no firewall/nginx.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Recuperação e manutenção</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">Se a geração parar, reinicie primeiro. Se a sessão tiver expirado, faça o login novamente.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
        <button type="button" data-action="start" class="rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 p-3 text-left transition hover:border-emerald-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
          <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-200">Iniciar gateway</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-400">Use quando estiver offline.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-action="restart" class="rounded-lg border border-violet-500/30 bg-violet-500/10 p-3 text-left transition hover:border-violet-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
          <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-violet-200">Reiniciar gateway</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-400">Reconecta Chrome e sessão.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-action="test" class="rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 p-3 text-left transition hover:border-sky-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
          <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-sky-200">Testar Sonnet 5</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-400">Confirma uma resposta curta.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-action="authorize" class="rounded-lg border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 p-3 text-left transition hover:border-amber-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
          <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-amber-200">Entrar novamente</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-400">Atualiza a sessão atual.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-action="switch" class="rounded-lg border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 p-3 text-left transition hover:border-rose-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
          <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-rose-200">Trocar conta Claude</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-snug text-slate-400">Sai só do Chrome isolado.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-4 grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-200">Onde a sessão fica gravada</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          A credencial fica na pasta privada <code class="rounded bg-slate-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-slate-300">~/.token-free-gateway</code> do usuário que executa o Node. Ela não é salva no banco, no navegador do ViralizeAI nem dentro de <code class="rounded bg-slate-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-slate-300">public/</code>.
        </p>
        <p id="claude-security-status" class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">Verificando a configuração de segurança…</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-4">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-200">Importante em produção</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          A janela de login abre na máquina onde o processo Node está rodando. Neste computador ela abre aqui; em um servidor remoto, ela abrirá no servidor e precisará de acesso à área de trabalho dele.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script id="claude-initial-status" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(initialStatus).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>
  <script id="ai-providers-initial" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(initialProviders).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>
  <script src="/js/claude-gateway-admin.js"></script>
<%- include('partials/app-end') %>
